+  descriptions, grapheme highlights, identity tokens and selection lookup
+  metadata) to 512 KiB. Contextual identity tokens are fixed-size fingerprints,
+  not copies of insertion values or provider names. Two overlapping generations
+  plus Reedline's bounded buffer/base copies and menu metrics fit the reserved
+  2 MiB display allowance; active reply/insertion values are accounted separately.
+  Empty/failure menus retain no redundant full-buffer display copy.
